            </table></div>
            <p>Submitted comments enter a moderation queue and are published only after the site owner approves them; rejected comments are not displayed. The system also generates a random deletion token for each comment, enabling you to delete that comment later.</p>
            <h3>Read automatically when you visit</h3>
            <div class="table-wrap"><table>
