              <tbody>
                <tr><td><code>unlocked</code></td><td>Cookie</td><td>Records the unlock status of a protected post; contains a page identifier and a signature, <strong>with no personal information</strong></td><td>30 days</td><td>No (functional)</td></tr>
                <tr><td><code>theme</code></td><td>Browser local storage</td><td>Stores the visitor's light or dark theme preference</td><td>Until you clear browser data</td><td>No (local only)</td></tr>
