            <ul>
              <li>Apart from <code>unlocked</code> and <code>_ga*</code>, which are sent with requests, all entries above reside only in the visitor's browser and are not uploaded to any server.</li>
              <li>Clearing browser data removes them all, with no effect on access to content.</li>
              <li><code>unlocked</code> is set with the <code>HttpOnly</code> and <code>SameSite=Lax</code> attributes; it cannot be read by page scripts and is used solely to determine unlock status. Its lifetime is 30 days.</li>
